                  skos:definition "crystallite with η-fiber texture orientation is a crystallite whose family of <001> equivalent directions in a cubic lattice system are oriented approximately parallel to the rolling direction."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/noes/NOES_0000158
noes:NOES_0000158 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  rdfs:label "crystallite with γ-fiber texture orientation"@en ;
                  skos:comment "Note: this class is  not intended to be asserted, but inferred based on the grain orientation relative to the rolling reference frame. It is a part of the macroscopic texture inference."@en ;
                  skos:definition "crystallite withγ-fiber texture orientation is a crystallite whose family of <111> equivalent directions in a cubic lattice system are oriented approximately parallel to the normal direction."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/noes/NOES_0000159
noes:NOES_0000159 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  rdfs:label "operating voltage"@en ;
                  skos:definition "operating g voltage is a process attribute of an assay which describes the value of a voltage applied to the electron source to extract electrons from the source and accelerate them in the direction of a sample"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/noes/NOES_0000160
noes:NOES_0000160 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  rdfs:comment """TODO refine the axiom: 
1. Add reference frames for sample and material?
2. longitudinal direction as sublcass of fiat line?""" ;
                  rdfs:label "angle to rolling direction"@en ;
                  skos:definition "Angle to rolling direction is a relational quality which characterizes the orientation of a sample cut from a rolled material in respect to the rolling direction (RD) of this material."@en ;
                  skos:example "Sample cut at 30° to rolling direction of a annealed nonoriented electrical steel."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/noes/NOES_0000161
noes:NOES_0000161 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  rdfs:subClassOf [ owl:intersectionOf ( [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                           owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000080 ;
